10	/**
11	 * BUNDLED HOSTING EMAIL — now PER-DOMAIN, not pinned to the setup subdomain.
12	 *
13	 * Hosting plans advertise "1 / 10 / 25 mailboxes included". This module mints the
14	 * COMPLIMENTARY EmailSubscription that delivers that promise — but the customer now
15	 * chooses WHICH of their account's domains it attaches to (the primary domain, a
16	 * subdomain, or a real addon domain they own), instead of it being hard-pinned to
17	 * the free `*.sites.nxeon.cloud` subdomain the account happened to be set up with.
