19	 * WHY per-domain: the free subdomain sits under a zone WE own, so a customer could
20	 * never publish the MX/SPF/DKIM a real mailbox needs — mail on it was a
21	 * deliverability dead-end. Attaching mail to a domain the customer controls (where
22	 * they add MX/SPF/DKIM at their registrar) is the only setup that actually works;
23	 * for a free subdomain WE auto-publish the records since we own that zone.
