/* ==========================================================================
 * Hosting console — the WEBSITE-FIRST plan workspace, on the portal's real design
 * system (components/ui/primitives + Icon + AppLogo + the global .card/.btn utility
 * classes). NO emojis: every glyph is an inline-SVG <Icon> or a brand <AppLogo>.
 *
 * The model (logic + UI over the existing storage — no DB migration):
 *   HostingAccount = the PLAN (a capacity pool: sites, storage, mailbox pool, DBs).
 *   "Websites" (the primary site + each addon/independent-subdomain/legacy subdomain)
 *   are first-class PEERS. Nothing is "primary-centric": the account's original
 *   domain is simply the first website in the grid.
 *
 * Two URL-addressable views (links survive refresh):
 *   • PLAN CONSOLE — a left section-nav scoping the plan:
 *       Overview · Websites · Domains · Email · Databases · Backups · Activity · Settings
 *     URL: `?tab=<section>` (default overview).
 *   • WEBSITE PAGE — a self-contained per-site console with a simple sub-nav
 *       Overview · Site/App · Domain & SSL · Email · Backups
 *     and an Advanced drawer folding Files · Database · PHP · Cron · SSH/SFTP ·
 *     Staging · Logs.  URL: `?site=<id|primary>&stab=<subtab>`.
 *
 * Every read/mutation is a real ownership-guarded server action — no mock data.
 * ======================================================================== */

